{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1522,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e83793aaf0d8287c1a3b259",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b931cbbc5ff834d619d16792036706cc06f14cf1a2024230235d3263006af89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a19cfbde5157369a99766bef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，怎么会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cc3fe7dc21fef2aeb89feb85f5a28c08b3b7fd4fd0ca440b87b4948ddaebc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c39ddd420315a372e1d4da61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可惜了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d9fa92e5cfaaa7166d7842391c34581d0236fdd1908606589454aab73daddce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ab86f3b85f7f0c10b11e84c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天我会为您准备这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8246de2c2722b6f157d8fee86c93e37548f1cede2d3327a483206008441fe3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b14072e58d8990e11cbc849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……啊，抱歉。\r\n没事的。\r\n无需担心，这点疲劳不算什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "853b2f0fa8a4f1fa922cd092d914062385d6de1e80f0e93373e4dc9abab41b32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a3688d0771cd712e7d85206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有您在看着我……\r\n身为骑士，不能退缩……\r\n不能退缩……呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41a7d9c9243353cd5f0c03b119ed1dab60f680be5fb5e95645ccf52aea39a662",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4356a81358e9ca06be942d8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会全力以赴。\r\n这是骑士的职责。\r\n请下达指令吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6cbc6de6e351ae8feef968a5cdb79c2ed8b455d789f5f6448650f805a1b79b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f41b4a45b13edad589b6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体变得轻盈了……\r\n全身仿佛化作利剑，\r\n变得更加锐利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0304e19fc5e883195a0d6238c83f8a6c68f8972cff65985046a20a7f448064a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35b73c5885af7b1465ae0dfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题。\r\n时刻保持万全是作为骑士理所应当的责任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef1c7f8b98259e3633b28ee1ab7779d2e4c2ba50b6f561be47edba564ef682f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13950685c4566e8898c16454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽管吩咐。\r\n我将以我那锋利无比的奔跑，\r\n来为您展现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e02a1b7eb61015437346f38a5d1c5abfbbd2e6f27f5ad7ab56c5645e4076786",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d2007a9a99b043414908ed6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "基本功很重要。\r\n必须反复练习，\r\n直到身体记住为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be127e330294d74fe493e06d6a73768f1459f955ccad2e8a601546634131c857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49159c5e8a86cea8495cb28e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备就绪了。\r\n让我们一起去锻炼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25c5f8f6c88989a2a738e6fd54c68d269671342af45956d1dbe1b13cd7dd267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be00c51c48c6d288d639e90d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时都不能松懈……\r\n必须更加坚定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2ec03080d79612af624796c529cc72f517b00f4cdfee2e95decb5ce2e1c9ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2de66ab9dd0d0ea46d810739",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得更加努力……\r\n这样下去，怎么配得上『骑士』的称号……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "478b9a4ab14807c4cdd158ca5cab0800da08f285ab8c7b92a44e04af881c37f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368bde6e70f757879d59918d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骑士精神就是……\r\n永不放弃……\r\n绝不……唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c61ba397463fa6a13038e62c5edfc7dfb6cce926cced70fdc7c41b2e803f0b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a3c294b0cc02bc45b9a91e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……一点问题都没有……\r\n我一如往常……\r\n完全没问题……真的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "496aec3d618650be150ba10f0abf1a43d975c76d79b39fe0eac984121e7b2322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8de23031dfa450e1cb8b6902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主君，\r\n战斗接连不断。\r\n请务必三思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bc655aa78735ea7be1f02e28915e5327dced84137be8d6c000415789a9b305",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:099ae3079ff1a00edc74f002",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可这样，主君。\r\n随意挥剑是得不到胜利的。请重新考虑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fedf2abe75c49de34929885060d528ee9745f8fb1aa6e4f70018990b67438ef1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3615f027a842db5401f656d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的『圣剑』是不灭的利刃……\r\n无人能折断。\r\n让我们一起走向顶峰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "063b0cd75d56cc6dde1ae25df5d05aa8ac2df1233b0027eb13644dae4b4fd73e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ec04d97aecd5a7a5b72643b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将以骑士之名，\r\n展示一场堂堂正正的比赛。\r\n为了我的荣耀和主君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d73e8293a5c459a778fc14b43f6e5f5bb9a7515417b28c86fd973a96f3cf9b58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e94218621539c4285229d79d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若能赢得胜利，\r\n让主君高兴……\r\n那一切就都值得了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea3146589e7b3f59c466c941f16a90535a81a39110551da51c5e1034c4d4492c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b49f7d8ceb2ecdd2ca215be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利将献给您。\r\n请相信我，稍作等待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d7e3141a65ddcc865bd809f8735383055a8497f7ef772a58378dc3f00f73904",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23c6791a9e1886a25a8b1a72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会成为败者。\r\n因为有我珍贵的主君\r\n在等待我的胜利归来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "250ac1e919827620d8954d8ffab21687bd38be4c1319673c6584f9eab5a524d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00a9ab34f4d5fc62e7f4abef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无所畏惧。\r\n我已为此付出无数的锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51a90e75f345eee832620642ff4eb5fe5dc766583b29115da42d3792697550c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cce2b0a3188ce40cb3484bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请放心。\r\n我不会让您担心我的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f79c57401e4e47064211df07b42c2dce45a79d2c7cdb755c224577dc82771056",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70efb03bd09f931c6ab6f4c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈，要开始了。\n四剑之一，狄奥尼修斯的雷戟……\n现在，就让您见识一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5c23c2c2af48136b290e9d7a35a3c1a5502d5bf75766edb652285e408023289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:291d94fe306dedc64bb9b86f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "磨砺过的剑中闪耀着光芒……\r\n没错，\r\n那正是现在的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "734346e2027a24a25c0cc4eacddf7eaedc79bc08d9135decedc7788cb88b2342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7257bd28e9e61c733dade5b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便前路满是荆棘，\r\n骑士的职责是为主君劈开道路……\r\n呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c1e6ed92e17c1fcffb7827f2bf63335777f91817fc173e779a5cee8ca86420b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b02cbd264cd9f3484859df2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然未到最佳状态，\r\n但我会尽全力赢得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a11c6b0b9a986d47aba466261fa8e3dce3934f0bf674151c43f51e38fc6938",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64e7435092f9c00b67f2dd33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正是在逆境中才能发光……\r\n对吧，\r\n骑士多旺达……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b46638459c0d30e89006d9a82381e34bb9023c61fefeb8f11b29419d04535e53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebba0be21e7df35e39c93837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……没事的，肯定没问题。\r\n我可是骑士啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c7d02b88e27237b5d76c9d712fa5cf060a3e2d7396b7df0e0626c0927fd240e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b15afa6d55c36a4d8b45cae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不，您不用担心。\r\n不管遇到什么情况，\r\n我都会是您的剑与盾……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfc32d44042b39494210af9199668e47c1d65a42888aed9354bcddbdcd64922f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ecd1634307049a092035d65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不想让您看到我的软弱……\r\n毕竟，\r\n我理想中的骑士……应该更加……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "429a35ff0bccee772350aff1f91126c2b760969ef075aa663d806f7d7b858782",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f8b6b5b1d2038c83886ab57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8167d1d045fa6f23c7c40620b76aa43604b384e653241623afc8b7061394a145",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a36925d9e0d20014c62648b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09cbec1a5f2f3a1c5bada8df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b52ec6a51ea86f04e77eb47b539df83710d70ffb623152a29d619d493402def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22cbdaf309dd3a0174f14e1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e0c015546750d7981eac848",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这点程度……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e98f3b642179db4634ce4c3e12dd1728cbfe117e143a796f8a93ad9b94c1c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aa41393b49ea9bf63775fb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d94aa904a2d5ae8c87d200a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "259094e5a27d8b74ef6c993df596f92eace76ba061f4116e7799ac4847d895f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fcc6661c3379ca269ac96bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是雄伟啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "00a96e3bc2e12ff2efe9f70bba05102f381511b699ccbd11c3754f10c45b1233",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2f03b5af0e5f3af0766ddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够与吾君一同前行，\n是我的骄傲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddb02271920c9bc35fa226f23f6cd5602461fda74e7adf02d7cc2cc49b8f77aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21119563ec33652f14a1794d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "艰难却充满乐趣的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1025b3c7fe3c9e170bc42e5ac2577ab8997e49f574658e3d3511d570e00c391",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43fa1b862e83dd4cae99c232",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪耀吧，我的『圣剑』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e6edf9a8b0fe928abc1f325dbf83f1cdc97cdcef26f0a9e76c8817e4ef234b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebcdab1f26e871221a6a9e19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e36fbccc1afd0f573cd3d8f897e3488e4336d872375cc4340fe31a60f44d59c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da8d66b10b23b13518641452",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集结在我的『圣剑』下吧，勇士们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5e5ca9c7dde835e4157628137a2136dbffaec21b19fd6c598a05da2c634c2f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efde2bdbdd7de4dbb16a6def",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是艰险却充满乐趣的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4f8d0e8ba631a7f63b3eb4845b8d241453fdc3683e102bd7fdcd1959231467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9be0775677d60905cb1d223",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么可畏惧的。\r\n这就是我一直以来\r\n积累的锻炼成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a1262ac2a04c211cacaebc4309e01da514a52b262874f4d688db2beb136909e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d825764eee8a9d39c4a42f25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果能取得胜利，\r\n让我的君主露出喜悦的笑容……\r\n那一定……就能……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a70a75cf07afb56f641b37ffa14ef02fccd28d1fb7aaa8abd0269bc5e0f4e51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fd8cff252c29e3049728e09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是艰险却充满乐趣的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4f8d0e8ba631a7f63b3eb4845b8d241453fdc3683e102bd7fdcd1959231467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94e5eb5ebf4fe60da719128f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8167d1d045fa6f23c7c40620b76aa43604b384e653241623afc8b7061394a145",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39106095023da3860c693721",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，差一步……下次一定！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c65db2f2e038eadd97a6b2601bdebe7623463e37a42addaa002466a0e2cd92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7130b17ecfde49e0316cef4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骑士的道路崎岖不平……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a849e6177ab392dfd1b9d1d8011f75bfcf1aa021cf2e537fce11bbe784a6b05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a40fc248474dc54d1c4904a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯有不断锻炼……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d1f7661bf0a4e23e5e8e420739b3370452fb7ba8f7fd61e2dd29a62efdf1fbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d27f83feaf09d04577223494",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是骑士的耻辱……",
      "source_fingerprint": "774aa4ac81b8ea975b49a075d016ee04d9fae5a08f9ba4e95299e4677c7bed5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cfe6e635b0ea1f3ad5d3fdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，请握住我的手。\r\n让我们踏上凯旋的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c17f947cb53ffc6b355c2575bb70f29dc88a1cf5254b3d5d3466daf5c38a0f8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1261cb16402d04613ae9bdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "献给吾君……胜利的一切皆为您。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a44e332b07a6c838a410be165c5612484e89520042a3cdb667ccab8d94733d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c704aa54d3057581af2cd2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae773f0956de8bd881f22b8026d8878020ed7aa60c72340db4f942fbc67355b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3667164cd068e245e760130e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发，前行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4da7cad52997be39e14b42b4daf5cb0c2560d71b38699836e0bd54426e740348",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b952e72c9916636ec91b3af8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尊贵的吾君！请您务必在特等席上…\n尽量披上帅气的披风，\n聆听您骑士的歌声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6190109f7d73585704ed4549b6b8b612d67601a6e1985b01ebfbdd79884d2a9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02da137377427de0d54dc279",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然参加被拒绝了，但她一直耐心\n地看我们练习……信念小姐，\n真是个笃实的人呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da39683f6029e13cda41d072a35e019ba33dae4fc23f5a6864e6948a52fab5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05aac6d21a173668a8ffcaea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的圣剑比闪电还要耀眼，\r\n拥有劈开黑暗的锋芒……\r\n请看吧！帕拉提纳斯·卢克斯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a3ecef74aa60b4122bcb8efeea4f718ac0e5db46cc508a6c6b642eba761792b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73a5d31333c7fd9676a93527",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最终游戏对决以3亿对3败北…  \n哼，我可不是会在这里气馁的人！  \n一定要再战，奇迹小姐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f320a1aef63fe45329093c147ffc94c3c520f20532aba5a253d6a4caccc56ddb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:260007b8287929bc7cab8a04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，前往闪耀的喝彩之海！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f12a029624a777820a411dd6cf8d7afa192e77bcd66d925196f0812a687ea3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f1a92d83ec0be61dc47868",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向民众表达感激吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c92296aa7e7834fa2f011bc22cc3a5c8c5ea9dd132fa07fe2cfbc4756325de9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd229048109c4f7f91a65ceb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此身既是您的剑——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fac55dbadf08633fb9e0d33dfaf5e8a7d064d3d2cf18e0551f4fd47fa3e8209",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8dfbe88ac781b47522a5a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是您的骑士多旺达，\r\n还记得我们叙事诗的开端吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3e1827fae3bd6f26cfc531c7e0cccbb89ad02f5f949b26ebb36295b9a5ddfff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79ee3f7c5e9e04dcfef6def7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为骑士，\r\n我应学习的还有很多……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce15580cd88067fa077cedb23166439a62c32ad102a757b883fd7e24e06d4b92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e1c156d2c5232a905ea41c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随着动作摇曳的裙摆……\r\n是为舞蹈而设计的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1aa33a7b98fb7d457e1611d06e1ad1f39cacfdd65036d824cea95b7c918af81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4b533310fdca85ac0fd408a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的信念、理想与梦想……\r\n都凝聚在这身衣装中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecdc031c8f75489325df72bcac4c4a995fccaf03b301d8bb16af12038f387a7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d44acb534b657303d61706b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要组建骑士团，\r\n制服该如何设计呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d97fa6deb62bd9bb90a4f06ff9be437949655358cacd73efda34813beda04ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:900a8d33fa659687ee784fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "统一的服装，\r\n确实能让人感受到团结的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b19e77d58bf881ed576f39ed2adc175b47b45478a0b045bb45c37098b018df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26314064da69be921b95f003",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有比这更适合挥舞『圣剑』的衣装了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b16c58a5806953e81747f1c8b97556aa49c6317f632807d9887d63487f4a585",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ee46b32296a6abeda7c5372",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便衣装更替，\r\n我的忠诚依旧不变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45e50fc0378e2cc4816243d82b6fb3aebf962bb5f31ad534aa9c68b28c33284a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:212b67760f1474d897e07963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为骑士，\r\n外表也必须得体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "202b0ae6e9a7ad2478c6efd346a1f93a2a3e280ab3f24c8ca424d67c9391faa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f476707c3dab9144ed3bb5de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您要出门吗？\n那么，就由我来陪同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afc2a1536692c90d65ddde9c3d6809c7287bd7f468a596ffaef6db1a745eb8e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db89a6035eb7d18d56f3f68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣服总是要方便活动的。\n当然，这是为了守护我的主君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a630136dd5de1ca2dd10e77a2f325aff06a5113f7f1ea4335c524ac38a5952a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5344bc76fff66cc5596cbe21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为骑士，\r\n我应学习的还有很多……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce15580cd88067fa077cedb23166439a62c32ad102a757b883fd7e24e06d4b92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089c5622cdcab144bce5b5fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随着动作摇曳的裙摆……\r\n是为舞蹈而设计的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1aa33a7b98fb7d457e1611d06e1ad1f39cacfdd65036d824cea95b7c918af81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fcc557c33c5031a859e9555",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的信念、理想与梦想……\r\n都凝聚在这身衣装中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecdc031c8f75489325df72bcac4c4a995fccaf03b301d8bb16af12038f387a7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "71009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
